  "id": "GA",
  "name": [
    "Camino da Geira e dos Arrieiros@pt",
    "Camino de la Geira y los Arrieiros@es",
    "Geira and Arrieiros Way@en"
  ],
  "description": {
    "text": "The Camino da Geira e dos Arrieiros connects Braga with Santiago. A large part of the Way follows part of the ancient Roman Road XVIII, built to connect Braga (Bracara Augusta) with Astorga (Asturica Augusta).",
    "image": {
      "title": [
        "Marco miliário XXIX da Via Romana XVIII@pt",
        "Milestone XXIX from the Via Romana XVIII@en"
      ],
